---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Open registration: Optical Fiber Networks | LED&T">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-fondo">
		<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
			<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.85fr)_minmax(0,1.15fr)] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
				<div class="lg:sticky lg:top-8">
					<img src="/images/noticias/flyer-fibra.jpeg" alt="Flyer for the Optical Fiber Networks extension course" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-strong object-contain bg-slate-100" />
					<p class="text-texto-tenue text-sm mt-3">Hands-on training in UNSJ laboratories.</p>
				</div>
				<article>
					<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-texto leading-tight mb-5">Optical Fiber Networks: Installation and Maintenance</h1>
					<span class="inline-flex rounded-md bg-red-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">Registration full until next year</span>
					<p class="text-acento font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Open registration · Extension course</p>
					<p class="text-texto-suave text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">The Faculty of Engineering at UNSJ, through the Department of Electronics and Automation (DEA) and the Digital Electronics and Telecommunications Laboratory (LED&amp;T), is accepting pre-registration for a new edition of this extension course.</p>
					<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-10">
						<div class="border border-borde rounded-md p-4"><p class="text-texto-tenue text-sm">Start</p><p class="font-bold text-texto">September 1, 2026</p></div>
						<div class="border border-borde rounded-md p-4"><p class="text-texto-tenue text-sm">End</p><p class="font-bold text-texto">November 10, 2026</p></div>
						<div class="border border-borde rounded-md p-4"><p class="text-texto-tenue text-sm">Schedule</p><p class="font-bold text-texto">Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday<br />7:00 to 9:00 pm</p></div>
						<div class="border border-borde rounded-md p-4"><p class="text-texto-tenue text-sm">Tuition</p><p class="font-bold text-texto">$450,000 in 3 payments of $150,000</p><p class="text-sm text-texto-suave">Materials included</p></div>
					</div>
					<div class="space-y-8 text-texto-suave leading-relaxed">
						<section><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-texto mb-2">Practical training</h2><p>The program totals <strong>100 clock hours</strong>, split into two 50-hour courses: Optical Fiber Fundamentals and Optical Fiber Network Installation and Maintenance. It covers transmission principles, cables, splices, connectors, light sources, transmitters, detectors, receivers, network installation, cable and link measurements, and fault detection.</p></section>
						<section><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-texto mb-2">Blended format and requirements</h2><p>The course is delivered in person with virtual support through the UNSJ SIED and Virtual Campus. Practical sessions take place in LED&amp;T laboratories using professional equipment, and all work materials are included. Applicants need basic knowledge of ICT, computing or related work, near visual acuity (glasses are allowed), steady fine motor skills, and the ability to identify colors under TIA-598. A computer with internet access is required.</p></section>
						<section><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-texto mb-2">Practice groups and certification</h2><p>To ensure access to professional equipment, Group A attends practical sessions on Tuesdays and Groups B and C on Wednesdays. Students who pass the theoretical and practical assessments with at least 80% attendance receive an Approval Certificate. Those who pass the theoretical component with 80% attendance may receive an Attendance Certificate even if they do not complete or pass the practical assessments.</p></section>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-10 border-l-4 border-acento bg-acento-suave p-5 rounded-r-md"><p class="font-bold text-texto mb-1">Academic continuation</p><p class="text-texto-suave">Students who complete the course may join the third stage of the program in 2027 and pursue the University Diploma in Optical Fiber Network Installation and Maintenance.</p></div>
					<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4"><a href="mailto:m.guzzo@unsj.edu.ar?subject=Pre-registration%20Optical%20Fiber%20Networks%20Course" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-primario text-white font-semibold hover:bg-primario-oscuro transition-colors">Contact us to register</a><span class="text-sm text-texto-suave">Information: <a href="mailto:m.guzzo@unsj.edu.ar" class="text-primario font-semibold hover:underline">m.guzzo@unsj.edu.ar</a></span></div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
